      "writtenOn": "2022-04-12T06:34:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It doesn\u0027t have much difference. We delay enabling DRP_TOGGLE for a few seconds until the XHCI init done (`gpio_ap_xhci_init_done\u003d1`). \n\nS5-\u003eS0: initially force sink and delay the DRP toggle at S0\nS0-\u003eS3-\u003eS0: no change for type-c state\nS0-\u003eS5: switch to force sink, no change.\nS0-\u003eS0 reboot AP: switch to force sink, and set to DRP_TOGGLE after XHCI ready.\n\n`gpio_ap_xhci_init_done` is managed by coreboot and it won\u0027t be changing until the AP reset.",
      "parentUuid": "e5cc1bfc_5288540a",
      "revId": "53543540fd35aebc723f28d2b8b229612db42a31",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
